# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(10^3)$$

- Space complexity: $$O(10)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int totalNumbers(int[] digits) {
        int count = 0;
        int[] freq = new int[10];

        for (int digit : digits) {
            freq[digit]++;
        }

        for (int i = 1; i <= 9; i++) {
            if (freq[i] == 0) {
                continue;
            }
            freq[i]--;

            for (int j = 0; j <= 9; j++) {
                if (freq[j] == 0) {
                    continue;
                }
                freq[j]--;

                for (int k = 0; k <= 8; k += 2) {
                    if (freq[k] == 0) {
                        continue;
                    }
                    freq[k]--;

                    int num = i * 100 + j * 10 + k;
                    count++;
                    freq[k]++;
                }
                freq[j]++;
            }
            freq[i]++;
        }

        return count;
    }
}
